<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender for 54,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender for 54,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's CK group will tender on Wednesday for a shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, Taiwan traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CK Group comprises Chia Hsin Flour Feed and Vegetable</p>
<p>Oil Corp and some buyers from Taiwan's southern port</p>
<p>city of Kaohsiung.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>		     U.S. Gulf     Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn    54,000  March 3-15    March 16-30</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
